Forms cheatsheet 
one form tag per page, inputs inside this tag get saved 
as many input tags as questions 
<input attribute="something"> as may attributes as needed 
types of attributes: 
    type=text 
        email
        password 
        color
type="submit" --> one per game, inside form tags 
name="__" --> need a name to save the form 
value="__" --> puts a value on the page 
                -multiple choice 
                -dropdown 
            *dont use this if you want the user to give the value, use a placeholder*
placeholder="__" --> text that dissapears when the user start writing 
id="__" --> used to connect another line of code like a label 
            -cannot share id's, just use it one time 
            -the name is essential, the id is optional 